# A screw thread on a face (an extension): the side of an extruded
# circle, picked on the model, fills the thread screen in from the face.
# The thread is started at the other end, made M20x1.5 and 25 long, and
# undone in one step; the context menu on the side offers Screw
# Thread... too.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
view rotated
move 336 207
down L 336 207
up L 336 207
menu Features|Screw Thread...
tw
# From the other end, the designation, the length, then make it.
twmove 60 250
twdown L 60 250
twup L 60 250
twmove 172 130
twdown L 172 130
twup L 172 130
edit M20x1.5
twmove 220 170
twdown L 220 170
twup L 220 170
edit 25
tw
twmove 37 280
twdown L 37 280
twup L 37 280
dump
save
# Undo takes the datum and the thread away at once.
key z ctrl
dump
key esc
popup Screw Thread...
move 336 207
down R 336 207
up R 336 207
tw
